{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015111634534-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015131147\"/><p>涉事扶手電梯。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>鰂魚涌有人於扶手梯跌倒。今日(15日)早上10時41分，一名老翁與外傭在英皇道1046至1056號一地庫商場使用扶手電梯時，突然失平衡跌倒，外傭頭髮捲入梳齒被夾困，在場一名保安員見狀，立即按緊急掣將電梯煞停。救援人員奉召到場替外傭解困後，兩人清醒由救護車送院治理，人員正調查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.095237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:16:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:10.100696+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:10.100696+00:00","content_hash":"d9b3a14c42dbc8067fbd515f831ae21cb3a9467884af3b3a6e1513c578f271f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}